import lib/process.dl

to get the live process test interpreter:
    return "python" if the process platform is Windows, else "python3"

set command to a process command for the live process test interpreter
add "-u" as an argument to command
add "-c" as an argument to command
add "import sys\nfor line in sys.stdin.buffer:\n sys.stdout.buffer.write(b'out:' + line); sys.stdout.buffer.flush()\n sys.stderr.buffer.write(b'err:' + line); sys.stderr.buffer.flush()" as an argument to command
launch command and set child to it

print line child was launched
poll child and set pending to it
print lines (pending succeeded) and (pending does not report completion)
read the available standard output of child and set initial to it
print lines (initial succeeded), (initial's contents = "") and (initial has not reached the end of stream)

write (the string form of "first\n") to the standard input of child and set request to it
print lines (request succeeded) and (request's byte count)
read the standard output of child and set response to it
read the standard error of child and set warning to it
print lines (response succeeded), (response's contents = "out:first\n") and (warning succeeded)
print line (warning's contents = "err:first\n")

write (the string form of "second\n") to the standard input of child and set followup to it
close the standard input of child and set closure to it
print lines (followup succeeded) and (closure succeeded)
read the standard output of child and set following to it
read the standard error of child and set failure to it
print lines (following's contents = "out:second\n") and (failure's contents = "err:second\n")

wait for child and set status to it
print lines (status succeeded), (status reports completion) and (status's exit code)
print line status does not report termination

set delay to a process command for the live process test interpreter
add "-c" as an argument to delay
add "import time; time.sleep(30)" as an argument to delay
launch delay and set sleeper to it
terminate sleeper and set termination to it
wait for sleeper and set terminated to it
print lines (sleeper was launched), (termination succeeded), (terminated succeeded) and (terminated reports completion)
print line terminated reports termination

launch delay and set orphan to it
clean up orphan and set cleanup to it
print lines (orphan was launched) and (cleanup succeeded)
